#. type: Title =
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "git-whatchanged(1)"
msgstr "git-whatchanged(1)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:7
msgid "git-whatchanged - Show logs with differences each commit introduces"
msgstr "git-whatchanged - 各コミットが導入する差分とともにログを表示"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:13
msgid "git whatchanged <option>..."
msgstr "git whatchanged <option>..."

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "WARNING"
msgstr "WARNING"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:19
msgid ""
"`git whatchanged` has been deprecated and is scheduled for removal in a "
"future version of Git, as it is merely `git log` with different defaults."
msgstr ""
"`git whatchanged` は、単にデフォルトが異なるだけの `git log` であるため非推奨"
"となっており、将来の Git のバージョンで削除される予定です。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:24
msgid "Shows commit logs and diff output each commit introduces."
msgstr "各コミットのコミットログとdiff出力を表示します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:28
msgid ""
"New users are encouraged to use linkgit:git-log[1] instead.  The "
"`whatchanged` command is essentially the same as linkgit:git-log[1] but "
"defaults to showing the raw format diff output and skipping merges:"
msgstr "新規ユーザーは、これの代わりに linkgit:git-log[1] を使用することをお勧めします。 `whatchanged` コマンドは基本的に linkgit:git-log[1] と同じですが、デフォルトで生の形式の差分出力を表示し、マージをスキップします:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "git log --raw --no-merges\n"
msgstr "git log --raw --no-merges\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The command is primarily kept for historical reasons; fingers of many people "
"who learned Git long before `git log` was invented by reading the Linux "
"kernel mailing list are trained to type it."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは主に歴史的な理由で維持されています。 `git log` が発明されるずっ"
"と前に Linux カーネルのメーリングリスト を読んで Git を学んだ多くの人々の指"
"は、 `whatchanged` と入力する癖がついています。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Examples"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git whatchanged -p v2.6.12.. include/scsi drivers/scsi`"
msgstr "`git whatchanged -p v2.6.12.. include/scsi drivers/scsi`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Show as patches the commits since version 'v2.6.12' that changed any file in "
"the include/scsi or drivers/scsi subdirectories"
msgstr ""
"include/scsi または drivers/scsi サブディレクトリ内のファイルを変更したバー"
"ジョン `v2.6.12` 以降のコミットをパッチとして表示する"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git whatchanged --since=\"2 weeks ago\" -- gitk`"
msgstr "`git whatchanged --since=\"2 weeks ago\" -- gitk`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Show the changes during the last two weeks to the file 'gitk'.  The \"--\" "
"is necessary to avoid confusion with the *branch* named 'gitk'"
msgstr ""
"過去2週間の変更をファイル `gitk` に表示します。 `--` は、「ブランチ名 "
"`gitk` 」との混同を避けるために必要です。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "GIT"
msgstr "GIT"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-whatchanged.adoc:53
msgid "Part of the linkgit:git[1] suite"
msgstr "Part of the linkgit:git[1] suite"
